---
// Features section - Linear-inspired card grid with hover glow
---

<section class="features" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-heading">
  <!-- Subtle background orb -->
  <div class="features-orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="features-header" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="features-heading" class="section-heading heading-glow">
        Todo lo que necesitas para<br />
        <span class="gradient-text">gestionar tu dinero</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Herramientas diseñadas para darte claridad y control total sobre tus finanzas personales, sin complicaciones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid" data-reveal-stagger>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
            <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
            <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
            <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
            <line x1="10" y1="6.5" x2="14" y2="6.5"/>
            <line x1="6.5" y1="10" x2="6.5" y2="14"/>
            <line x1="17.5" y1="10" x2="17.5" y2="14"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Dashboard interactivo</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Visión general de tus finanzas con balance mensual, gráficos y transacciones recientes en un solo vistazo.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 1v22"/>
            <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Gestión de transacciones</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Registra ingresos y gastos con categorías, añade notas y mantén un historial completo de cada movimiento.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/>
            <line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Estadísticas y gráficos</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Visualiza tus patrones de gasto con gráficos interactivos: vistas anuales, mensuales y por categoría.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Múltiples billeteras</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Gestiona varias cuentas independientes con saldos separados. Ideal para separar ahorros, gastos y presupuestos.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/>
            <polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Transacciones recurrentes</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Automatiza gastos fijos como alquiler, suscripciones y facturas con alertas que te avisan antes del vencimiento.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/>
            <path d="M12 1v2"/>
            <path d="M12 21v2"/>
            <path d="M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42"/>
            <path d="M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42"/>
            <path d="M1 12h2"/>
            <path d="M21 12h2"/>
            <path d="M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42"/>
            <path d="M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="feature-title">Temas personalizables</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">Alterna entre modo claro y oscuro según tu preferencia. La interfaz se adapta para una experiencia visual cómoda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    padding: 7rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .features-orb {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 800px;
    height: 800px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-glow) 0%, transparent 60%);
    filter: blur(120px);
    opacity: 0.25;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .features-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.875rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Linear-style card — tight radius, subtle border */
  .feature-card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border);
    transition: background 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    cursor: default;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Subtle interior accent glow on hover */
  .feature-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(52,211,153,0.08) 0%, transparent 55%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(52,211,153,0.2), 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .feature-card:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .feature-icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 10%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.125rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .features {
      padding: 4.5rem 1rem;
    }
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .features-header {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
